testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @plain = rect 10, 10, 100, 100
  @rounded = rect 10, 10, 100, 100, 20
end
----------- test code
assert_includes [nil, 0], rect("@plain").curve, "without a fifth argument the corners are square"
assert_equal 20, rect("@rounded").curve, "the fifth argument is the corner radius"
